{"parse": {"title": "CO-01", "pageid": 100917, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-02\" title=\"CO-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.81.BF.E9.9B.A8.E6.8C.87.E5.8D.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"避雨指南\">避雨指南</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 避雨指南</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">How to Find Shelter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>宇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>宙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>并<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>辜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呼……再来一次深呼吸，然后……放轻松……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>第一场演出最不能失败。这关系着我的、科兹洛夫的、大家的荣誉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>娜塔莉亚女士教过，重点是让吸进的气流在身体里找到平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>左脚，右脚——好。接下来，适当地伸手和观众打招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啊，糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不，别着急，我能做到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先站稳。在一根纤细的钢丝上找到立足之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它真的存在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我能应对一切……只要先……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>宇宙中没有绝对的方向之分，下落同时也能是上升。这取决于你使用的参照体系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>她有权知道“暴雨”意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我们要先抵达九九年之后的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>阿涅娅。回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>库珀花环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-563920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>生命体征，平稳。各项指标均有回升。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病床前的拉普拉斯研究员尚未褪去奔波的疲惫。医疗职员揣摩着她的心情，斟酌词句说明目前的状况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>我听说您之前不在发射基地，没想到还是第一时间赶回了这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>既然您这样关心他们，我想您应该能明白我接下来这些话的意思，指针女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针点了点头，目光依然落在床边那些医疗仪器闪烁的屏幕上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>实验事故造成的外伤并不严重，库珀花环小姐只是需要休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>考虑到她的身体状况，我不建议她立刻离开病房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针没有回应这句话。在几秒钟的停顿后，她开口询问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>辛苦了。其他人的情况怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>冷周六小姐要好些，之前还醒来了十五分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>利用这点儿时间，她迅速要求签署了遗体捐献协议书。甚至没忘记让她的兄弟姐妹们也签字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>……另外两位先生和她做了差不多的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>这倒都没什么，疯子我见得够多了。麻烦的是决定治疗方案。太多细节都要注意，特殊剂量、抗药性……而且我没有任何动物医疗经验，只能申请协助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>虽然这么说不太合适，但还好您没有参与这次……勇敢的尝试。不然我连一个帮手也找不着了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针的目光从病床上收回。她直视着职员的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我不赞成他们，但他们毕竟也算是我的组员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>如果哪天有了规制法案，教会这群家伙重视生命，我一定双手双脚赞成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>举个例子，首先限制苦目糖的使用？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>噢，这就算了吧。我自己偶尔也会多来两颗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>下个月我就要调任去康复中心总部了，我会帮你问问那儿的苦目糖平均用量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>但现在，比起这个，我看得先给来探病的人排张时间表……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第二位来访者很好地说明了时间表之必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>她的情况还好吗？我刚从另一边的病房过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然响起的声音礼貌而亲切，但依旧让两位职员吃了一惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>您好，北方哨歌女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>根据今天的检查结果来看，库珀花环小姐的身体情况已经基本稳定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>我们无法确保她何时苏醒。但好消息是，预期时间为这周内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>辛苦了。我会常来探望——严格按照规定行动，尽量少添麻烦，我记着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>这间病房还好，隔离室几乎静音。在常规病房内的确需要保持安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我理解，我理解。我只是有些担心，而且维拉女士和阿夫西维总是在信里问起大家的近况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>老师和学生多少都会挂念对方，这也没办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>明白。我正好也该去忙其他事了。如果碰上什么问题，就用那边的呼叫按钮找我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>顺带一提，指针女士——祝您的组员一切顺利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">医疗职员：</div><div>一群打算上太空的疯子，我觉得还挺酷的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是句意料外的称赞，指针的脸上明明白白地写满了惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我也希望一切顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……您真的认为我们能成功？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>您瞧，“我们”。您不是已经打算退出这个小组了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的沉默之后，她们默契地略过了对方的反问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌率先迈开步子，指针跟着她来到走廊，回手带上了房门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>看来您并没有像声称的那样，坚持认为冷周六的想法不切实际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>干脆回来搭把手？我觉得利用传送软盘是个很不错的主意，而且实验失败本就是常事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你和冷周六合作过这么久，理应比我更清楚她是不是在做无用功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针又一次选择了沉默。但北方哨歌并没有再次与她达成默契。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你到底怎么想？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我怎么想不重要。我劝过他们很多次，停下吧，到这里就可以了。<br />但他们听得越多就越打算坚持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我只想知道你是否认为冷周六他们必定失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>难道我必须站在这里一五一十地向你剖析我的想法？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌指向她的身后，那间她们刚刚离开的医务室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我有自己的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>冷周六是一位很好的研究员，足够敏锐，也向来果断。我从来没有不信任她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>但谁来保证计划百分百成功，谁来面对失败的后果？不是进医务室躺几个月、几年，而是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的肩膀在发颤，但她的声音异常的平静和稳定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这是我的个人想法，我希望自己的同事们能……活下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>就算真到了太空，拿到了数据，明白了宇宙是否会被“暴雨”冲刷……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>即使宇宙不受影响，我们又能怎么办？逃去一颗新的星球？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>如果“暴雨”连我们头顶的群星都会带走，那知道这样的结果又有什么意义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这个答案并不值得如此追求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果你真的这样想，应该把刚刚的话说给他们听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我在等一个合适的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理线学者耸了耸肩，她已经得知了自己需要的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>总之，我这里有个新消息。虽然你很快也会知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>发射基地将逐步开始清空撤离，最迟半个月后，至少拉普拉斯的所有职员都必须离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>撤离？有不少难以搬运的设备，要去哪里？而且你应该清楚这里的很多项目和国家合作开发……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她猛然抬起头，北方哨歌没有回避她的视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……回真正的、不受影响的普列谢茨克分部，北极圈边缘，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这是“暴雨”应急预案！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>拉普拉斯职员回去报到后，可以在休养中心度过一周。那些不属于科算中心管辖的员工，他们将从今天起迎来带薪假期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们都清楚这场“带薪假期”将何时中止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>冷周六也在等合适的时机。现在她等到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>帮她签名吧。放心，这份不是捐献协议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张纸被递到面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>你要我向路德维希先生提交申请，叫他特批我的组员留下送死？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不，我只是帮忙转交它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>他们相当清楚自己要面对的困难。这不是一次徒有勇气的赌博。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>所以我愿意尽举手之劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……我现在没心情考虑。之后再说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>别让你的组员等得太久，这很可能是最后的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-632912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-632912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-632912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把那张纸用力塞进了外套口袋，隔着玻璃看向病床上静静沉睡的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在几个月前，她们还未曾料想到事情会发展到如此境地。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-01"}}